    "title": "<p>Diagnostic criteria for MALT lymphoma of the dura</p>",
    "legend": "",
    "source": "Section contributors - separate source citation not necessary",
    "copyright": "",
    "tablehtml": "<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"width: 16.0cm; background: #DAEEF3; border-collapse: collapse; \" border=\"0\" width=\"605\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\" page-break-inside: avoid; height: 10.2pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 16.0cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 10.2pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"605\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><em>Essential:</em></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\" page-break-inside: avoid; height: 10.2pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 16.0cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 10.2pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"605\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; \">A dural-based lymphoma composed of tumour cells with morphological characteristics of marginal zone B&nbsp;cells with small or medium-sized nuclei and pale cytoplasm</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\" page-break-inside: avoid; height: 10.2pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 16.0cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 10.2pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"605\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong style=\"\"><span style=\"color: black; \">AND</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\" page-break-inside: avoid; height: 10.2pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 16.0cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 10.2pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"605\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; \">Immunohistochemical expression of B-cell markers (CD20, CD79a) with demonstration of meshworks of CD21+, CD23+, CD35+ follicular dendritic cells</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\" page-break-inside: avoid; height: 10.2pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 16.0cm; background: #EFF6FC; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 10.2pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"605\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><em><span style=\"color: black; \">Desirable:</span></em></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\" page-break-inside: avoid; height: 10.2pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 16.0cm; background: #EFF6FC; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 10.2pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"605\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; \">FISH analysis for trisomies and MALT lymphoma&ndash;associated translocations</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\" page-break-inside: avoid; height: 10.2pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 16.0cm; background: #EFF6FC; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 10.2pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"605\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; \">Gene rearrangement studies to document clonality, if not already proved by immunophenotyping</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>",
